        "created_at": "2025-08-05T00:05:58.647Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Seriously, they aren’t all that common these days so it was a pleasant surprise to stumble on this one:</p>\n<aside class=\"onebox allowlistedgeneric\" data-onebox-src=\"https://rpgs.wtf/2025/06/15/actual-play-sentinel-comics-rpg/\">\n  <header class=\"source\">\n      <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/0/0287a931de894b02a2cd73836e98729d94c3caa6.png\" class=\"site-icon\" data-dominant-color=\"9B0C0C\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\">\n\n      <a href=\"https://rpgs.wtf/2025/06/15/actual-play-sentinel-comics-rpg/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\" title=\"03:49PM - 15 June 2025\">Don't Roll a One – 15 Jun 25</a>\n  </header>\n\n  <article class=\"onebox-body\">\n    <div class=\"aspect-image\" style=\"--aspect-ratio:440/220;\"><img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/c/c48b3d880d6e069ee89b7a6910edc33b4a5bbb46.jpeg\" class=\"thumbnail\" data-dominant-color=\"897D7D\" width=\"440\" height=\"220\"></div>\n\n<h3><a href=\"https://rpgs.wtf/2025/06/15/actual-play-sentinel-comics-rpg/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">Actual Play: Sentinel Comics RPG</a></h3>\n\n  <p>The Sentinel Comics Roleplaying Game (SCRPG) has been on my “get it to the table” list for a while. I got it to the table!</p>\n\n\n  </article>\n\n  <div class=\"onebox-metadata\">\n    \n    \n  </div>\n\n  <div style=\"clear: both\"></div>\n</aside>\n\n<p>Sounds like that whole group really gets what makes the game sing.  And Frankenstein’s Mobster is a villain name par excellence.  <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/slight_smile.png?v=12\" title=\":slight_smile:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":slight_smile:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"></p>",
