        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/rabit/{size}/7330_2.png",
        "created_at": "2025-08-11T14:41:28.248Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I think it can also depend on the player. If I’m running it, there are some players I know would rather not have to come up with a twist, while there are others that revel in such opportunities! I’ll usually include that as part of session 0 discussions to ensure we’re all on the same page as to how they individually want to come up with twists.</p>\n<p>Just another factor for us to consider. <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/smirk.png?v=12\" title=\":smirk:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":smirk:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"></p>",
